WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.955 --> 00:00:18.256
City Grand Hotel was hosting a fancy party.

2
00:00:19.177 --> 00:00:21.178
All of Metro City's richest people were there.

3
00:00:21.198 --> 00:00:24.180
"What a lovely party!"

4
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.021
said a woman with a diamond necklace.

5
00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:29.442
"Yes, it is," said another woman.

6
00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:32.064
She had a large ruby pinned to her dress.

7
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.540
Suddenly there was a loud noise.

8
00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:37.721
Rumble! Rumble!

9
00:00:37.741 --> 00:00:40.722
"I hear motorcycles," said a man.

10
00:00:41.802 --> 00:00:43.543
A bolt of electricity flashed.

11
00:00:44.263 --> 00:00:46.303
Zap! The lights went out.

12
00:00:47.204 --> 00:00:49.264
When they came back on, everyone screamed.

13
00:00:50.585 --> 00:00:52.925
"Our jewelry!"

14
00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:53.885
a woman cried.

15
00:00:53.905 --> 00:00:56.106
"Someone stole it!"

16
00:01:00.127 --> 00:01:00.727
said Jack.

17
00:01:00.747 --> 00:01:03.228
"I can see Mars perfectly!"

18
00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:06.221
Roxy and her friends were in Jack's backyard.

19
00:01:07.121 --> 00:01:08.742
They were using Jack's new telescope.

20
00:01:08.762 --> 00:01:11.003
"Can I have a turn now?"

21
00:01:11.263 --> 00:01:11.823
asked Mara.

22
00:01:11.843 --> 00:01:13.824
"Sure," said Jack.

23
00:01:14.805 --> 00:01:17.066
He stepped back and let Mara look through the telescope.

24
00:01:17.086 --> 00:01:18.986
"I see Mars!"

25
00:01:19.307 --> 00:01:19.727
she said.

26
00:01:19.747 --> 00:01:22.128
"It's red and rocky!"

27
00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.989
"Do you see any Martians?"

28
00:01:25.689 --> 00:01:26.490
Terrell laughed.

29
00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:29.211
"Ha-ha!" Mara laughed too.

30
00:01:29.231 --> 00:01:31.472
"I don't see any Martians!"

31
00:01:32.724 --> 00:01:34.286
Jack opened a book about space.

32
00:01:34.306 --> 00:01:37.268
"Let's try to find this galaxy next!"

33
00:01:38.209 --> 00:01:39.730
He pointed to a colorful picture.

34
00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:43.033
"Cool!" said Terrell.

35
00:01:43.053 --> 00:01:45.795
"First we have to find it on your star chart."

36
00:01:46.636 --> 00:01:48.338
Terrell unfolded the star chart.

37
00:01:49.218 --> 00:01:50.419
Roxy leaned in to look.

38
00:01:50.439 --> 00:01:54.803
"We need to look between those two stars," she said.

39
00:01:55.724 --> 00:01:58.086
Roxy pointed to two bright stars on the chart.

40
00:01:58.106 --> 00:02:00.348
"Okay," said Jack.

41
00:02:01.184 --> 00:02:02.926
He spotted the two stars in the sky.

42
00:02:03.926 --> 00:02:05.808
Mara turned the telescope toward the stars.

43
00:02:06.849 --> 00:02:09.911
"It would be so cool to be an astronaut," she said.

44
00:02:09.931 --> 00:02:13.214
"I would love to go into space in a rocket!"

45
00:02:14.395 --> 00:02:16.677
"Astronauts are cool," said Terrell.

46
00:02:16.697 --> 00:02:19.659
"But you know who's even cooler than an astronaut?"

47
00:02:19.679 --> 00:02:22.421
"Let me guess," said Roxy.

48
00:02:22.441 --> 00:02:23.962
"Rocket Girl."

49
00:02:23.982 --> 00:02:26.545
"Yeah!" Terrell grinned.

50
00:02:26.565 --> 00:02:30.588
"An astronaut needs a rocket to fly in space.

51
00:02:31.468 --> 00:02:34.130
But Rocket Girl can fly in space without one."

52
00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:39.035
"Well, I think astronauts are pretty cool anyway," said Roxy.

53
00:02:39.975 --> 00:02:41.217
Terrell's eyes lit up.

54
00:02:41.237 --> 00:02:45.280
"Maybe Rocket Girl is flying through space right now!

55
00:02:46.421 --> 00:02:48.443
We should try to find her with the telescope!"

56
00:02:49.424 --> 00:02:50.224
Roxy laughed.

57
00:02:50.244 --> 00:02:53.727
"I don't think Rocket Girl is up there right now."

58
00:02:54.848 --> 00:02:56.089
Just then her watch beeped.

59
00:02:57.511 --> 00:02:58.892
She stepped away from her friends.

60
00:03:07.676 --> 00:03:09.537
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered.

61
00:03:09.557 --> 00:03:11.397
"Is there a problem?"

62
00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:14.118
"Yes, Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

63
00:03:14.138 --> 00:03:16.319
"There's a terrible problem!

64
00:03:17.299 --> 00:03:19.680
Someone has robbed the jewelry convention!

65
00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:25.842
All the jewels—diamonds, rubies, pearls—they were all stolen!"

66
00:03:25.862 --> 00:03:28.903
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

67
00:03:29.663 --> 00:03:31.444
"Rocket Girl will find the thief!"
